                     ) were 0.1332 hr−1, 0.5301 (mg COD mg−1 MLSS) and 0.0072 hr−1, respectively. The UV Fenton-SBR (C) process is effective in treatment of pesticide wastewater containing chlorpyrifos, cypermethrin and chlorothalonil to meet Malaysian industrial effluent discharge standard.
